IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1 -- piece dg5, layer 1.
-- Sections 241 (amendment of the certificate of incorporation before receipt of payment for stock)
-- and 242 (amendment after receipt of payment for stock; nonstock corporations).
--
-- The source is the plain-text rendering de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt of the Delaware Code Online (through 85 Del. Laws, c. 550).
-- It is not the official text. `-- src:N | ...` is line N of that file; an ellipsis means the line goes on.
--
-- Section 114(b)(1) takes sections 241 and 242 out of the stockholder-to-member reading: both address nonstock corporations by their own terms
-- (section 241(c); section 242(a) "after a nonstock corporation has members" and paragraph (b)(3)). So the corporation's kind is a real input here.
-- A vote is counted in votes, not shares (core, section 212(a)); a proportion is an exact fraction (core `a majority of`).
-- Filing and effectiveness are section 103 (piece dg1); the "executed, acknowledged and filed" fact is an input.

§ `Section 241 -- amendment before receipt of payment for stock`

-- out of range: section 114(d) (piece dg1)
-- src:1004 | (a) Before a corporation has received any payment for any of its stock, it may amend its certificate of incorporation at any time or times, in any and as many respects as may be desired, so long as its certificate of incorporation as amended would contain only such provisions as it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate of incorporation filed at the time of filing the amendment.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 241(a) (src:1004); § 242(a) (src:1010)
-- Section 241 governs a stock corporation that has not received payment for any of its stock, and (subsection (c)) a nonstock corporation that has no members yet;
-- section 242(a) governs the corporation once it has received payment for any capital stock, or a nonstock corporation once it has members.
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the nonstock corporation has members` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 241 the section governs the amendment` k `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` `the nonstock corporation has members` MEANS
    IF `the kind is a stock corporation` k
    THEN NOT `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock`
    ELSE NOT `the nonstock corporation has members`

-- out of range: section 114(d) (piece dg1)
@ref 8 Del. C. § 241(a) (src:1004)
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the nonstock corporation has members` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amended certificate would contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 241(a) the corporation may amend its certificate of incorporation` k `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` `the nonstock corporation has members` `the amended certificate would contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment` MEANS
        `s 241 the section governs the amendment` k `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` `the nonstock corporation has members`
    AND `the amended certificate would contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment`

-- src:1005 | The amendment of a certificate of incorporation authorized by this section shall be adopted by a majority of the incorporators, if directors were not named in the original certificate of incorporation or have not yet been elected, or, if directors were named in the original certificate of incorporation or have been elected and have qualified, by a majority of the directors. …
-- src:1006 | (c) This section will apply to a nonstock corporation before such a corporation has any members; provided, however, that all references to directors shall be deemed to be references to members of the governing body of the corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 241(b) (src:1005); § 241(c) (src:1006)
-- "if directors were not named in the original certificate of incorporation or have not yet been elected" the incorporators adopt; otherwise the directors,
-- once they were named or elected "and have qualified". For a nonstock corporation "directors" is read as members of the governing body (subsection (c)).
-- The directors' majority is counted against the whole board (Fork F5). NOTHING: the counts cannot be a vote.
DECLARE `dg5 s 241(b) Adoption of an amendment before payment` HAS
    `directors were named in the original certificate of incorporation or have been elected and have qualified` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of incorporators`                    IS A NUMBER
    `the number of incorporators voting in favor`    IS A NUMBER
    `the number of directors`                        IS A NUMBER
    `the number of directors voting in favor`        IS A NUMBER

@ref 8 Del. C. § 241(b) (src:1005)
GIVEN a IS A `dg5 s 241(b) Adoption of an amendment before payment`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 241(b) the amendment has been adopted by the incorporators or the directors` a MEANS
    IF a's `directors were named in the original certificate of incorporation or have been elected and have qualified`
    THEN `the vote carries` (`a majority of` `the whole board`) (a's `the number of directors voting in favor`) (a's `the number of directors`)
    ELSE `the vote carries` (`a majority of` `the incorporators`) (a's `the number of incorporators voting in favor`) (a's `the number of incorporators`)

-- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
-- src:1005 | A certificate setting forth the amendment and certifying that the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock, or that the corporation has no members, as applicable, and that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with this section shall be executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103 of this title. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 241(b) (src:1005)
GIVEN `the certificate sets forth the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate certifies that the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock, or that the corporation has no members, as applicable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate certifies that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with section 241` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 241(b) the certificate of amendment is in order` `the certificate sets forth the amendment` `the certificate certifies that the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock, or that the corporation has no members, as applicable` `the certificate certifies that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with section 241` `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` MEANS
        `the certificate sets forth the amendment`
    AND `the certificate certifies that the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock, or that the corporation has no members, as applicable`
    AND `the certificate certifies that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with section 241`
    AND `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103`

-- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
-- src:1005 | Upon such filing, the corporation’s certificate of incorporation shall be deemed to be amended accordingly as of the date on which the original certificate of incorporation became effective, except as to those persons who are substantially and adversely affected by the amendment and as to those persons the amendment shall be effective from the filing date.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 241(b) (src:1005)
-- The amendment takes effect as of the day the original certificate became effective, except as to persons substantially and adversely affected,
-- as to whom it is effective from the filing date. Filing under section 103 is piece dg1; the two days are inputs.
GIVEN `the date on which the original certificate of incorporation became effective` IS A DATE
      `the filing date under s 103` IS A DATE
      `the person is substantially and adversely affected by the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DATE
`s 241(b) the date from which the amendment is effective as to the person` `the date on which the original certificate of incorporation became effective` `the filing date under s 103` `the person is substantially and adversely affected by the amendment` MEANS
    IF   `the person is substantially and adversely affected by the amendment`
    THEN `the filing date under s 103`
    ELSE `the date on which the original certificate of incorporation became effective`

§ `Section 242(a) -- the power to amend, and the changes it lists`

-- out of range: section 114(d) (piece dg1)
-- src:1010 | After a corporation has received payment for any of its capital stock, or after a nonstock corporation has members, it may amend its certificate of incorporation, from time to time, in any and as many respects as may be desired, so long as its certificate of incorporation as amended would contain only such provisions as it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate of incorporation filed at the time of the filing of the amendment …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(a) (src:1010)
GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
      `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the nonstock corporation has members` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amended certificate would contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(a) the corporation may amend its certificate of incorporation` k `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` `the nonstock corporation has members` `the amended certificate would contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment` MEANS
        (NOT (`s 241 the section governs the amendment` k `the corporation has received payment for any of its stock` `the nonstock corporation has members`))
    AND `the amended certificate would contain only provisions that it would be lawful and proper to insert in an original certificate filed at the time of filing the amendment`

-- src:1011 | (1) To change its corporate name; or
-- src:1012 | (2) To change, substitute, enlarge or diminish the nature of its business or its corporate powers and purposes; or
-- src:1013 | To increase or decrease its authorized capital stock or to reclassify the same, by changing the number, par value, designations, preferences, or relative, participating, optional, or other special rights of the shares, or the qualifications, limitations or restrictions of such rights, or by changing shares with par value into shares without par value, or shares without par value into shares with par value either with or without increasing or decreasing the number of shares, or by subdividing or combining the issued shares of any class or series of a class of shares into a greater or lesser number of issued shares; or
-- src:1014 | (4) To cancel or otherwise affect the right of the holders of the shares of any class to receive dividends which have accrued but have not been declared; or
-- src:1015 | (5) To create new classes of stock having rights and preferences either prior and superior or subordinate and inferior to the stock of any class then authorized, whether issued or unissued; or
-- src:1016 | (6) To change the period of its duration; or
-- src:1017 | (7) To delete:
-- src:1018 | a. Such provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporator or incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares; and
-- src:1019 | b. Such provisions contained in any amendment to the certificate of incorporation as were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock, if such change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation has become effective.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(a)(1) to (7) (src:1011-1019)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(a) Change a corporation may make by amendment` IS ONE OF
    `a change of the corporate name`
    `a change, substitution, enlargement or diminution of the nature of its business or its corporate powers and purposes`
    `an increase or decrease of the authorized capital stock or a reclassification of it`
    `the cancellation of, or other effect on, the right of the holders of the shares of a class to receive dividends which have accrued but have not been declared`
    `the creation of new classes of stock having rights and preferences prior and superior, or subordinate and inferior, to the stock of any class then authorized`
    `a change of the period of its duration`
    `the deletion of the provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares`
    `the deletion of provisions of an amendment that were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective`

-- Paragraph (d)(1)(A) speaks of "changes described in paragraph (a)(1) or (7)": the name, and both deletions in (7).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(a)(1) (src:1011); § 242(a)(7) (src:1017-1019); § 242(d)(1) (src:1028)
GIVEN c IS A `dg5 s 242(a) Change a corporation may make by amendment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(a) the change is described in paragraph (a)(1) or (a)(7)` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a change of the corporate name` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the deletion of the provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the deletion of provisions of an amendment that were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- src:1020 | Any or all such changes or alterations may be effected by 1 certificate of amendment.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(a) (src:1020)
GIVEN `the number of changes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(a) the changes may be effected by 1 certificate of amendment` `the number of changes` MEANS
    `the number of changes` AT LEAST 1

§ `Section 242(b)(1) -- how a stock corporation adopts an amendment`

-- src:1022 | (1) If the corporation has capital stock, its board of directors shall adopt a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed, declaring its advisability, and either calling a special meeting of the stockholders entitled to vote in respect thereof for the consideration of such amendment or directing that the amendment proposed be considered at the next annual meeting of the stockholders. Such special or annual meeting shall be called and held upon notice in accordance with § 222 of this title. The notice shall set forth such amendment in full or a brief summary of the changes to be effected thereby unless such notice constitutes a notice of internet availability of proxy materials under the rules promulgated under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 [15 U.S.C. § 78a et seq.]. At the meeting a vote of the stockholders entitled to vote thereon shall be taken for and against any proposed amendment that requires adoption by stockholders. If no vote of stockholders is required to effect such amendment, or if a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon, and a majority of the outstanding stock of each class entitled to vote thereon as a class has been voted in favor of the amendment, a certificate setting forth the amendment and certifying that such amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with this section shall be executed, acknowledged and filed and shall become effective in accordance with § 103 of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Vote of a class on an amendment` HAS
    `the class is entitled to vote as a class on the amendment`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of votes of the class in favor of the amendment`   IS A NUMBER
    `the number of outstanding votes of the class`                 IS A NUMBER

-- out of range: the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (federal law, not among the inputs)
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Adoption of an amendment by a corporation with capital stock` HAS
    `the board of directors adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the resolution declared the amendment advisable`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the resolution called a special meeting of the stockholders entitled to vote or directed that the amendment be considered at the next annual meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the meeting was called and held upon notice in accordance with s 222`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice set forth the amendment in full or a brief summary of the changes`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the notice constitutes a notice of internet availability of proxy materials under the rules promulgated under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a vote of stockholders is required to adopt the amendment`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of votes in favor of the amendment`                                      IS A NUMBER
    `the number of outstanding votes entitled to vote on the amendment`                  IS A NUMBER
    `the classes entitled to vote as a class`                                            IS A LIST OF `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Vote of a class on an amendment`

-- "a majority of the outstanding stock of each class entitled to vote thereon as a class has been voted in favor".
-- NOTHING: the counts of that class cannot be a vote.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
GIVEN c IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Vote of a class on an amendment`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(1) the class has voted in favor` c MEANS
    IF c's `the class is entitled to vote as a class on the amendment`
    THEN `the vote carries` (`a majority of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`) (c's `the number of votes of the class in favor of the amendment`) (c's `the number of outstanding votes of the class`)
    ELSE JUST TRUE

@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
GIVEN cs IS A LIST OF `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Vote of a class on an amendment`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(1) every class entitled to vote as a class has voted in favor` cs MEANS
    IF   any (GIVEN c YIELD `s 242(b)(1) the class has voted in favor` c EQUALS NOTHING) cs
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST (all (GIVEN c YIELD `s 242(b)(1) the class has voted in favor` c EQUALS JUST TRUE) cs)

@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
GIVEN a IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Adoption of an amendment by a corporation with capital stock`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(1) the board of directors has taken the steps` a MEANS
        a's `the board of directors adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed`
    AND a's `the resolution declared the amendment advisable`
    AND a's `the resolution called a special meeting of the stockholders entitled to vote or directed that the amendment be considered at the next annual meeting`

-- The notice "shall set forth such amendment in full or a brief summary of the changes to be effected thereby unless such notice constitutes a notice of internet availability of proxy materials".
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
GIVEN a IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Adoption of an amendment by a corporation with capital stock`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(1) the meeting was called on a notice as the paragraph requires` a MEANS
        a's `the meeting was called and held upon notice in accordance with s 222`
    AND (   a's `the notice set forth the amendment in full or a brief summary of the changes`
         OR a's `the notice constitutes a notice of internet availability of proxy materials under the rules promulgated under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934`)

-- The stockholders have approved when no vote is required, or a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote
-- and a majority of the outstanding stock of each class entitled to vote as a class were voted in favor (both: cumulative, Fork F6).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
GIVEN a IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Adoption of an amendment by a corporation with capital stock`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(1) the stockholders have approved the amendment` a MEANS
    IF NOT a's `a vote of stockholders is required to adopt the amendment`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE CONSIDER `the vote carries` (`a majority of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`) (a's `the number of votes in favor of the amendment`) (a's `the number of outstanding votes entitled to vote on the amendment`)
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
         WHEN JUST overall THEN
             IF overall
             THEN `s 242(b)(1) every class entitled to vote as a class has voted in favor` (a's `the classes entitled to vote as a class`)
             ELSE JUST FALSE

@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
GIVEN a IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(1) Adoption of an amendment by a corporation with capital stock`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(1) the amendment has been duly adopted` a MEANS
    IF   (`s 242(b)(1) the board of directors has taken the steps` a) AND (`s 242(b)(1) the meeting was called on a notice as the paragraph requires` a)
    THEN `s 242(b)(1) the stockholders have approved the amendment` a
    ELSE JUST FALSE

-- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
-- "a certificate setting forth the amendment and certifying that such amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with this section shall be executed, acknowledged and filed
-- and shall become effective in accordance with § 103" (out of range: section 103, piece dg1).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(1) (src:1022)
GIVEN `the amendment has been duly adopted under s 242(b)(1)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the certificate certifies that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with section 242` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(1) the amendment becomes effective in accordance with s 103` `the amendment has been duly adopted under s 242(b)(1)` `the certificate certifies that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with section 242` `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the amendment has been duly adopted under s 242(b)(1)`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST adopted THEN
        JUST (adopted AND `the certificate certifies that the amendment has been duly adopted in accordance with section 242` AND `the certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103`)

§ `Section 242(b)(2) -- the class vote`

-- src:1023 | (2) The holders of the outstanding shares of a class shall be entitled to vote as a class upon a proposed amendment, whether or not entitled to vote thereon by the certificate of incorporation, if the amendment would increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of such class, increase or decrease the par value of the shares of such class, or alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of the shares of such class so as to affect them adversely. If any proposed amendment would alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of 1 or more series of any class so as to affect them adversely, but shall not so affect the entire class, then only the shares of the series so affected by the amendment shall be considered a separate class for the purposes of this paragraph. The number of authorized shares of any such class or classes of stock may be increased or decreased (but not below the number of shares thereof then outstanding) by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of the stock of the corporation entitled to vote irrespective of this subsection, if so provided in the original certificate of incorporation, in any amendment thereto which created such class or classes of stock or which was adopted prior to the issuance of any shares of such class or classes of stock, or in any amendment thereto which was authorized by a resolution or resolutions adopted by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of such class or classes of stock.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(2) (src:1023)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Effect of a proposed amendment on a class` HAS
    `the amendment would increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of the class` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the amendment would increase or decrease the par value of the shares of the class`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the amendment would alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of the shares of the class so as to affect them adversely` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the amendment would so affect only 1 or more series of the class and not the entire class`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate provides that the number of authorized shares of the class may be changed by the vote of a majority of the stock entitled to vote` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the amendment would take the number of authorized shares of the class below the number then outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:1023 | (2) The holders of the outstanding shares of a class shall be entitled to vote as a class upon a proposed amendment, whether or not entitled to vote thereon by the certificate of incorporation, if the amendment would increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of such class, increase or decrease the par value of the shares of such class, or alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of the shares of such class so as to affect them adversely. If any proposed amendment would alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of 1 or more series of any class so as to affect them adversely, but shall not so affect the entire class, then only the shares of the series so affected by the amendment shall be considered a separate class for the purposes of this paragraph. The number of authorized shares of any such class or classes of stock may be increased or decreased (but not below the number of shares thereof then outstanding) by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of the stock of the corporation entitled to vote irrespective of this subsection, if so provided in the original certificate of incorporation, in any amendment thereto which created such class or classes of stock or which was adopted prior to the issuance of any shares of such class or classes of stock, or in any amendment thereto which was authorized by a resolution or resolutions adopted by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of such class or classes of stock.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(2) (src:1023)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Who votes as a class` IS ONE OF
    `no class vote is required on the amendment under paragraph (b)(2)`
    `the holders of the whole class vote as a class`
    `only the holders of the series so affected vote as a separate class`

-- "The number of authorized shares of any such class ... may be increased or decreased (but not below the number of shares thereof then outstanding)
-- by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of the stock of the corporation entitled to vote irrespective of this subsection, if so provided" in the certificate.
-- src:1023 | The number of authorized shares of any such class or classes of stock may be increased or decreased (but not below the number of shares thereof then outstanding) by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of the stock of the corporation entitled to vote irrespective of this subsection, if so provided in the original certificate of incorporation, in any amendment thereto which created such class or classes of stock or which was adopted prior to the issuance of any shares of such class or classes of stock, or in any amendment thereto which was authorized by a resolution or resolutions adopted by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of such class or classes of stock.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(2) (src:1023)
GIVEN e IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Effect of a proposed amendment on a class`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(2) the number of authorized shares may be changed by a majority of the stock entitled to vote irrespective of the class vote` e MEANS
        e's `the certificate provides that the number of authorized shares of the class may be changed by the vote of a majority of the stock entitled to vote`
    AND (NOT e's `the amendment would take the number of authorized shares of the class below the number then outstanding`)

@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(2) (src:1023)
GIVEN e IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Effect of a proposed amendment on a class`
GIVETH A `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Who votes as a class`
`s 242(b)(2) the holders who vote as a class on the amendment` e MEANS
    IF   (e's `the amendment would increase or decrease the aggregate number of authorized shares of the class` AND (NOT (`s 242(b)(2) the number of authorized shares may be changed by a majority of the stock entitled to vote irrespective of the class vote` e)))
      OR e's `the amendment would increase or decrease the par value of the shares of the class`
      OR (e's `the amendment would alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of the shares of the class so as to affect them adversely` AND (NOT e's `the amendment would so affect only 1 or more series of the class and not the entire class`))
    THEN `the holders of the whole class vote as a class`
    ELSE IF   e's `the amendment would alter or change the powers, preferences, or special rights of the shares of the class so as to affect them adversely`
         THEN `only the holders of the series so affected vote as a separate class`
         ELSE `no class vote is required on the amendment under paragraph (b)(2)`

-- The holder's own question: do I vote as a class? Whole class: every holder of the class. Series: only a holder of a series so affected.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(2) (src:1023)
GIVEN w IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(2) Who votes as a class`
      `the holder's shares are of the class` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the holder's shares are of a series so affected` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(2) the holder is entitled to vote as a class` w `the holder's shares are of the class` `the holder's shares are of a series so affected` MEANS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `no class vote is required on the amendment under paragraph (b)(2)` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the holders of the whole class vote as a class` THEN `the holder's shares are of the class`
    WHEN `only the holders of the series so affected vote as a separate class` THEN `the holder's shares are of a series so affected`

§ `Section 242(b)(3) and (4) -- a nonstock corporation; a certificate that requires a greater vote`

-- src:1024 | (3) If the corporation is a nonstock corporation, then the governing body thereof shall adopt a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed and declaring its advisability. If a majority of all the members of the governing body shall vote in favor of such amendment, a certificate thereof shall be executed, acknowledged and filed and shall become effective in accordance with § 103 of this title. The certificate of incorporation of any nonstock corporation may contain a provision requiring any amendment thereto to be approved by a specified number or percentage of the members or of any specified class of members of such corporation in which event such proposed amendment shall be submitted to the members or to any specified class of members of such corporation in the same manner, so far as applicable, as is provided in this section for an amendment to the certificate of incorporation of a stock corporation; and in the event of the adoption thereof by such members, a certificate evidencing such amendment shall be executed, acknowledged and filed and shall become effective in accordance with § 103 of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(3) (src:1024)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(b)(3) Adoption of an amendment by a nonstock corporation` HAS
    `the governing body adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed and declaring its advisability` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of members of the governing body`                  IS A NUMBER
    `the number of members of the governing body voting in favor`  IS A NUMBER
    `the certificate requires approval by a specified number or percentage of the members or of a specified class of members` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the members or the specified class of members approved the amendment by that number or percentage` IS A BOOLEAN

-- "If a majority of all the members of the governing body shall vote in favor of such amendment": a majority of the whole governing body (the core's `the whole board`).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(3) (src:1024)
GIVEN a IS A `dg5 s 242(b)(3) Adoption of an amendment by a nonstock corporation`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 242(b)(3) the amendment has been duly adopted` a MEANS
    IF NOT a's `the governing body adopted a resolution setting forth the amendment proposed and declaring its advisability`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE CONSIDER `the vote carries` (`a majority of` `the whole board`) (a's `the number of members of the governing body voting in favor`) (a's `the number of members of the governing body`)
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
         WHEN JUST g THEN
             JUST (g AND ((NOT a's `the certificate requires approval by a specified number or percentage of the members or of a specified class of members`)
                          OR a's `the members or the specified class of members approved the amendment by that number or percentage`))

-- src:1025 | (4) Whenever the certificate of incorporation shall require for action by the board of directors of a corporation other than a nonstock corporation or by the governing body of a nonstock corporation, by the holders of any class or series of shares or by the members, or by the holders of any other securities having voting power the vote of a greater number or proportion than is required by any section of this title, the provision of the certificate of incorporation requiring such greater vote shall not be altered, amended or repealed except by such greater vote.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(b)(4) (src:1025)
-- The provision of the certificate requiring a vote greater than any section of the title requires "shall not be altered, amended or repealed except by such greater vote":
-- the vote needed to alter it is the greater vote itself. NOTHING: the certificate requires no such greater vote, so this paragraph adds no requirement.
GIVEN `the greater vote the certificate requires of the board, the governing body, a class or series, the members or other securities having voting power` IS A MAYBE `Vote requirement`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Vote requirement`
`s 242(b)(4) the vote needed to alter, amend or repeal the provision requiring the greater vote` `the greater vote the certificate requires of the board, the governing body, a class or series, the members or other securities having voting power` MEANS
    `the greater vote the certificate requires of the board, the governing body, a class or series, the members or other securities having voting power`

§ `Section 242(c) and (d) -- abandonment; amendments that need no stockholder vote`

-- src:1026 | (c) The resolution authorizing a proposed amendment to the certificate of incorporation may provide that at any time prior to the effectiveness of the filing of the amendment with the Secretary of State, notwithstanding authorization of the proposed amendment by the stockholders of the corporation or by the members of a nonstock corporation, the board of directors or governing body may abandon such proposed amendment without further action by the stockholders or members.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(c) (src:1026)
GIVEN `the resolution authorizing the proposed amendment provides for abandonment before the amendment is effective` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the filing of the amendment with the Secretary of State has become effective` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(c) the board of directors or governing body may abandon the proposed amendment without further action by the stockholders or members` `the resolution authorizing the proposed amendment provides for abandonment before the amendment is effective` `the filing of the amendment with the Secretary of State has become effective` MEANS
        `the resolution authorizing the proposed amendment provides for abandonment before the amendment is effective`
    AND (NOT `the filing of the amendment with the Secretary of State has become effective`)

-- src:1030 | A provision of the certificate of incorporation providing that the number of authorized shares of 1 or more classes of stock may be increased or decreased by the affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of the stock (or a majority of the votes of such stock) of the corporation entitled to vote irrespective of the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2) of this section shall not constitute an express requirement to obtain an additional or greater vote than is provided by this subsection, unless such provision expressly states that the corporation is not to be governed by paragraph (d)(1) or (2), or both, of this section or such provision requires a greater or additional vote than is contemplated by the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2) of this section.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d) (src:1030)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(d) Certificate provision on the number of authorized shares` HAS
    `the certificate provides that the number of authorized shares of 1 or more classes may be increased or decreased by a majority of the stock entitled to vote irrespective of the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that provision expressly states that the corporation is not to be governed by paragraph (d)(1) or (2), or both` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that provision requires a greater or additional vote than is contemplated by the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certificate otherwise expressly requires a meeting or vote of stockholders` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:1027 | (d) Notwithstanding the provisions of subsection (b) of this section, unless otherwise expressly required by the certificate of incorporation:
-- Subsection (d) applies "unless otherwise expressly required by the certificate of incorporation". The closing paragraph says when the majority-vote provision counts as such an express requirement:
-- only if it expressly says the corporation is not governed by (d)(1) or (2), or requires a greater or additional vote than the last sentence of (b)(2) contemplates.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d) (src:1027); § 242(d) (src:1030)
GIVEN p IS A `dg5 s 242(d) Certificate provision on the number of authorized shares`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(d) the certificate expressly requires otherwise` p MEANS
        p's `the certificate otherwise expressly requires a meeting or vote of stockholders`
     OR (    p's `the certificate provides that the number of authorized shares of 1 or more classes may be increased or decreased by a majority of the stock entitled to vote irrespective of the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)`
         AND (   p's `that provision expressly states that the corporation is not to be governed by paragraph (d)(1) or (2), or both`
              OR p's `that provision requires a greater or additional vote than is contemplated by the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)`))

-- src:1028 | (1) No meeting or vote of stockholders shall be required to adopt an amendment that (A) affects only changes described in paragraph (a)(1) or (7) of this section; or (B) reclassifies by subdividing the issued shares of a class of stock into a greater number of issued shares of the same class of stock (and, in connection therewith, such amendment may increase the number of authorized shares of such class of stock up to an amount proportionate to the subdivision), provided the corporation has only 1 class of stock outstanding and such class is not divided into series; and
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d)(1) (src:1028)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(d)(1) Subdivision of the issued shares of a class` HAS
    `the amendment reclassifies by subdividing the issued shares of a class into a greater number of issued shares of the same class` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the corporation has only 1 class of stock outstanding`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `that class is divided into series`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of issued shares of the class before the subdivision` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of issued shares of the class after the subdivision`  IS A NUMBER
    `the number of authorized shares of the class before the amendment` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of authorized shares of the class after the amendment`  IS A NUMBER

-- Paragraph (d)(1)(B): the authorized number may rise "up to an amount proportionate to the subdivision" (Fork F7):
-- authorized after / authorized before is at most issued after / issued before, written without division as a cross-product.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d)(1) (src:1028)
GIVEN s IS A `dg5 s 242(d)(1) Subdivision of the issued shares of a class`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(d)(1)(B) the amendment is a subdivision that needs no vote` s MEANS
        s's `the amendment reclassifies by subdividing the issued shares of a class into a greater number of issued shares of the same class`
    AND s's `the corporation has only 1 class of stock outstanding`
    AND (NOT s's `that class is divided into series`)
    AND (s's `the number of authorized shares of the class after the amendment` TIMES s's `the number of issued shares of the class before the subdivision`)
          AT MOST (s's `the number of authorized shares of the class before the amendment` TIMES s's `the number of issued shares of the class after the subdivision`)

@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d)(1) (src:1028)
GIVEN changes IS A LIST OF `dg5 s 242(a) Change a corporation may make by amendment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(d)(1)(A) the amendment affects only changes described in paragraph (a)(1) or (7)` changes MEANS
        count changes AT LEAST 1
    AND all (GIVEN c YIELD `s 242(a) the change is described in paragraph (a)(1) or (a)(7)` c) changes

@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d)(1) (src:1027-1028)
GIVEN `the amendment affects only changes described in paragraph (a)(1) or (7)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amendment is a subdivision that needs no vote under paragraph (d)(1)(B)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate expressly requires otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(d)(1) no meeting or vote of stockholders is required to adopt the amendment` `the amendment affects only changes described in paragraph (a)(1) or (7)` `the amendment is a subdivision that needs no vote under paragraph (d)(1)(B)` `the certificate expressly requires otherwise` MEANS
        (`the amendment affects only changes described in paragraph (a)(1) or (7)` OR `the amendment is a subdivision that needs no vote under paragraph (d)(1)(B)`)
    AND (NOT `the certificate expressly requires otherwise`)

-- out of range: the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (federal law, not among the inputs)
-- src:1029 | (2) An amendment to increase or decrease the authorized number of shares of a class of capital stock or an amendment to reclassify by combining the issued shares of a class of capital stock into a lesser number of issued shares of the same class of stock may be made and effected, without obtaining the vote or votes of stockholders otherwise required by subsection (b) of this section if: (A) the shares of such class are listed on a national securities exchange immediately before such amendment becomes effective and meet the listing requirements of such national securities exchange relating to the minimum number of holders immediately after such amendment becomes effective, (B) at a meeting called in accordance with paragraph (b)(1) of this section, a vote of the stockholders entitled to vote thereon, voting as a single class, is taken for and against the proposed amendment, and the votes cast for the amendment exceed the votes cast against the amendment, and (C) if the amendment increases or decreases the authorized number of shares of a class of capital stock for which no provision has been made pursuant to the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2) of this section, the votes cast for the amendment by the holders of such class exceed the votes cast against the amendment by the holders of such class.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d)(2) (src:1029)
DECLARE `dg5 s 242(d)(2) Amendment of the number of authorized shares by a listed corporation` HAS
    `the amendment increases or decreases the authorized number of shares of a class of capital stock or reclassifies by combining the issued shares of a class into a lesser number of issued shares of the same class` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the shares of the class are listed on a national securities exchange immediately before the amendment becomes effective` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the shares meet the listing requirements of that exchange relating to the minimum number of holders immediately after the amendment becomes effective` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a meeting was called in accordance with paragraph (b)(1) and a vote of the stockholders entitled to vote, voting as a single class, was taken for and against the proposed amendment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the votes cast for the amendment`                          IS A NUMBER
    `the votes cast against the amendment`                      IS A NUMBER
    `the amendment increases or decreases the authorized number of shares of a class for which no provision has been made under the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the votes cast for the amendment by the holders of that class`     IS A NUMBER
    `the votes cast against the amendment by the holders of that class` IS A NUMBER

-- "the votes cast for the amendment exceed the votes cast against the amendment": a comparison of two counts, not a proportion of a base (Fork F8).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 242(d)(2) (src:1029)
GIVEN a IS A `dg5 s 242(d)(2) Amendment of the number of authorized shares by a listed corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 242(d)(2) the amendment may be made without the vote otherwise required by subsection (b)` a MEANS
        a's `the amendment increases or decreases the authorized number of shares of a class of capital stock or reclassifies by combining the issued shares of a class into a lesser number of issued shares of the same class`
    AND a's `the shares of the class are listed on a national securities exchange immediately before the amendment becomes effective`
    AND a's `the shares meet the listing requirements of that exchange relating to the minimum number of holders immediately after the amendment becomes effective`
    AND a's `a meeting was called in accordance with paragraph (b)(1) and a vote of the stockholders entitled to vote, voting as a single class, was taken for and against the proposed amendment`
    AND a's `the votes cast for the amendment` GREATER THAN a's `the votes cast against the amendment`
    AND (   (NOT a's `the amendment increases or decreases the authorized number of shares of a class for which no provision has been made under the last sentence of paragraph (b)(2)`)
         OR a's `the votes cast for the amendment by the holders of that class` GREATER THAN a's `the votes cast against the amendment by the holders of that class`)
